              "value": "Lunar Burst"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, occult)\n\nThe bul-gae releases a blast of otherworldly frost that deals 6d8 cold damage to each creature in a 10-foot emanation (34 basic Reflex save). On a critical failure, a creature also becomes slowed 2 for 1 round. After using this ability, the bul-gae's flames heat up and they can't use Lunar Burst again until after they've used their Solar Flare reaction."
